    "type": "home",
    "storyId": "00000021059002",
    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "買い出しへの同行、感謝する。\nなかなかの量だったからな、助かったぞ。",
            "enText": "Thank you for coming shopping with me.\nI needed a lot of items, so your help was\nmuch appreciated.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -1980647677220659743,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "先輩のお役に立てたなら、嬉しいです！\nところで――",
            "enText": "I'm glad I could help! By the way…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 694825525068651550,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "今日通りかかったドッグカフェ……\r\nよかったら今度、一緒に行きませんか？",
            "enText": "You know that dog cafe we passed today?\nWould you like to go there together someday?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -3452243125480238944,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "！？　……か、構わないが……なぜだ？",
            "enText": "Th-That's fine with me, but… why do you ask?",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 2763242538301529396,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "えっ？　前を通る時、ちょっと先輩の歩調が\r\n緩くなった気がしたので……\n興味があるのかなって。",
            "enText": "Hm? Well, you slowed down as we\nwalked past it, so I thought maybe\nyou were interested…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -6452374971416508078,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "あのっ、アタシも大好きなんです、犬！\n小さい子も大きい子も、可愛いですよね！",
            "enText": "You know, I love dogs too! Big ones, small\nones — they're all cute! Don't you think?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 2152089923563075359,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "む……そう、だな。うむ。……甚だ同意だ。",
            "enText": "Hm… yes, I suppose. Yes.\nThey're very cute indeed.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 4740656325978345788,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "あ、あれ……？　すみません、\n誘ってしまったの、ご迷惑でしたか……？",
            "enText": "Um… I'm sorry, was my invite\na little too imposing?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 4165436200943016329,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "……いや、反省しただけだ。",
            "enText": "…No, I was just reflecting.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 2439153043543028759,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メジロドーベル",
            "enName": "Mejiro Dober",
            "jpText": "反省？　……えっ、先輩が！？",
            "enText": "You were? About what?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -3651493196324301620,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エアグルーヴ",
            "enName": "Air Groove",
            "jpText": "ああ。……お前の素直さを\nぜひ見習わせてくれ、ドーベル。",
            "enText": "Yes. I was thinking that I'd like to learn\nfrom your candidness, Dober.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 6138622730568949950,
            "blockIdx": 11
        }
    ],
    "modified": 1780179544,
    "humanTl": true
}